msgid ""
"While not yet very common, smart batteries are easier to attach and detach "
"from the vehicle and are capable of providing more information on the state "
"of the battery including capacity, individual cell voltages, temperature, "
"etc."
msgstr "智能电池目前虽不十分普及，但其安装拆卸更为方便，且能提供更多电池状态信息，包括容量、各单体电压、温度等。"

