#: aa78ce57f992485f96361cce39157847
msgid ""
"For adding more batteries, set :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` & "
":ref:`BATT2_I2C_BUS <BATT2_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>`, "
":ref:`BATT3_MONITOR <BATT3_MONITOR>` & :ref:`BATT3_I2C_BUS "
"<BATT3_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>`,etc."
