"如需添加更多电池，请设置 :ref:`BATT2_MONITOR <BATT2_MONITOR>` 和 :ref:`BATT2_I2C_BUS "
"<BATT2_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>`、:ref:`BATT3_MONITOR <BATT3_MONITOR>`"
" 和 :ref:`BATT3_I2C_BUS <BATT3_I2C_BUS__AP_BattMonitor_INA2xx>` 等。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-smart-battery-landingpage.rst:32
