msgid ""
"Restart the board and connect with a ground station and check the battery "
"voltage appears. The :ref:`BATT_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` parameter should "
"be automatically updated to the batteries actual capacity in mAh."
msgstr ""
"重启主板并使用地面站连接，检查电池电压是否显示。:ref:`BATT_CAPACITY <BATT_CAPACITY>` "
"参数应自动更新为电池的实际容量（mAh）。"

